ense of… satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894940/extras/10b4d39941f3d78691891a36f59ebaf6.poster.avif?t=1762780104\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894940/extras/10b4d39941f3d78691891a36f59ebaf6.webm?t=1762780104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894940/extras/10b4d39941f3d78691891a36f59ebaf6.mp4?t=1762780104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We’d Love to Hear Your Feedback!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your thoughts on social media!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please include the hashtag <strong>#NEKOTISSUE</strong> when you post!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Streaming &amp; Video Upload Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome gameplay videos and live streams of <strong>&quot;NEKO TISSUE&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'd appreciate it if you could include a link to the store page in your video description.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monetization</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is only allowed through official features provided by video sharing or streaming platforms.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prohibited Activities</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please do not use this game for content that violates laws, public standards or decency, or for defamatory purposes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*<i>These guidelines may change without prior notice.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epilepsy Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights 